+        "of judging sets one at a time; without that global propagation a "
+        "solver must branch among statistically identical sets."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track A: Section 1 inherits NP-completeness from r-Set Packing, and "
+        "shipping uses the Section 4.1 unit-weight alpha-Weight regime with "
+        "r=18 and k=24 growing linearly along the named ladder; Theorem 3.2's "
+        "O(r^(rk) k^((r+1)k) n^(cr)) FPT algorithm is not an efficient "
+        "small-k shortcut here, and G5/G6 measure the capped exact-search "
+        "cost on this planted degree-balanced distribution."
