+        "sheets; without recognizing that covering decomposition, a solver must "
+        "materialize and search the compatibility relation."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Theorems 3.1 and 3.2 give the BST-alpha FPT algorithm with "
+        "running time O(r^(rk) k^((r+1)k) N^(cr)); the shipping reference instead "
+        "uses exact compatibility-table construction and component propagation in "
+        "O(|E| q^2 r), averaging 204,528 positive-element probes and 0.0923 s at "
+        "the hard shipping preset, while the sheet route uses 279 exact comparisons "
