diff --git a/gen_1601_03676.py b/gen_1601_03676.py
index cd09b8390c1a785857dbfc9d67132991da85a806..14e304bd98e85a5c1624eea0398e111bbd6d38f8
--- a/gen_1601_03676.py
+++ b/gen_1601_03676.py
@@ -1,10 +1,14 @@
-"""Verified weighted-overlap set-packing generator for arXiv:1601.03676.
+"""Self-contained verified generator for arXiv:1601.03676.
 
-The paper defines r-Set Packing with alpha()-Overlap.  This module uses its
-Section 4.1 alpha-Weight function with unit element weights and threshold zero:
-two selected sets are compatible exactly when they are disjoint.  Instances
-are inverse-generated as degree-balanced incidence systems with a planted
-packing; the witness is known before the remaining incidences are sampled.
+The paper defines r-Set Packing with an arbitrary, well-conditioned overlap
+predicate and proves a bounded-search-tree FPT algorithm.  This module uses the
+paper's alpha-Weight predicate (Lemma 7) directly.  Candidate sets are arranged
+as a finite covering of a connected constraint graph: the zero-conflict pairs
