+the universe makes numeric element statistics independent of the planted role.
+This defeats the outlier statistic.  Independent option permutations defeat
+the equal-option ansatz.  The first two displayed groups are nonadjacent but
+their option-zero candidates lie on different sheets; connectedness therefore
+makes the left-to-right no-backtracking prefix impossible to complete.  Finally,
+q^n versus q valid sheets defeats random restart.  The successful
+compatibility/component algorithm is reported separately because this is Track B.
+""".strip()
