+        "global sheet coordinate; without recognizing that invariant, a solver "
+        "must materialize and search the compatibility relation."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Theorems 3.1 and 3.2 give the BST-alpha FPT algorithm with "
+        "running time O(r^(rk) k^((r+1)k) N^(cr)); the shipping reference instead "
+        "uses exact compatibility-table construction and component propagation in "
+        "O(|E| q^2 r), averaging about 204,500 positive-element probes at the hard "
+        "shipping preset, while the anchor-residue sheet route uses 64 exact "
