I caught a subtler issue in that tightening: using the arbitrary integer *names* of universe elements as modular data would make the shortcut disappear under a valid universe relabelling. I’m moving the offset into the anchors’ nonnegative weights, which are native Section 4.1 data and are transported with the elements. The insight then becomes a genuine invariant of the weighted set system, not a label-encoding trick.
