The answer is `[[0,1],[1,2],[2,2],[3,1],[4,2],[5,1]]`.
`verify(inst, answer)` returns `(True, "ok")`. Dropping the last pair returns
`(False, "expected exactly 6 group-option pairs, received 5")`.

