-solved 8/8, averaging 7,168 candidate-pair comparisons, 204,635.875 exact
-positive-element probes, 32 component nodes, and 0.0469 seconds in CPython. The
+The measured reference algorithm indexes every candidate occurrence of each
+positive universe element, constructs the local compatibility tables, and
